152 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 82 0 R
/E (Across India, employment discovery is digitally dark especially for the masses. People and employers are nearby but invisible to each other. Lists sit in registers and spreadsheets, jobs are shared through word of mouth, and trust breaks down when information cannot be verified.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
153 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 82 0 R
/E (The Blue Dot approach tackles this by enabling timely, credible discovery. It helps districts make local youth, women, any other segment and local jobs visible on a digital map, so they can find and trust each other continuously, not accidentally or with great cost, time and effort.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
