196 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 83 0 R
/E (Dharwad and Ghaziabad showed how fixing timely, credible discovery can turn a static local labour market into a living, functioning digital employment ecosystem. When local youth and employers were placed as blue dots on a digital map, proximity surfaced as something very meaningful since both employers and talent are keen on vicinity. Youth & women could see jobs nearby, and employers discovered talent close by that they did not know existed. Hiring became faster, cheaper, and more predictable.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
